{"name":"Sword +1, Dancing","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"The wielder must fight with this sword in-hand for four rounds. Each round adds +1 to its magical bonus. At the beginning of the fifth round, the sword leaps from the wielder’s hand and attacks independently for four rounds with the bonus decreasing from +4 to +1 each round. The sword is considered in the “hand” of the attacking character with respect to hit and damage rolls (and any relevant bonuses of the player character). The sword takes up a standard 5x5 foot space relative to attacking adjacent foes. At the end of the four rounds of independent combat, the sword falls to the ground.","damage":"1d8","bonus":1,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"A7b9J1LcMQ3P9XkR"}
{"name":"Sword +1, Flame Tongue","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This red-bladed sword grows in power subject to the opponent type. The sword has a base +1 bonus, but strengthens to +2 versus regenerating monsters, +3 versus cold-using, inflammable, or avian monsters, and, finally, +4 versus undead. When the sword-wielder speaks the command word (typically carved on the blade), the sword ignites in flame. The flame sheds the equivalent of torchlight and ignites flammable materials.","damage":"1d8","bonus":1,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"G6c1L4XdOR7U5WmN"}
{"name":"Sword +1, Life Drinker","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This sword drains one level of experience (or hit die) on a successful hit and when the command word is spoken. This sword possesses 1d4+4 charges. Each use costs one charge. Once completely drained of charges, it loses its abilities and performs as a Sword +1.","damage":"1d8","bonus":1,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"Q9x3Y8TkNE4H7VbK"}
{"name":"Sword +1, Luck Blade","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"The wielder of this sword receives +1 on all saving throws.","damage":"1d8","bonus":1,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"J2w4K7HqUI9S3LnV"}
{"name":"Sword +1, Wish Blade","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This sword acts as a Sword +1, and contains 1d3 Wishes as per the spell. Once drained of wishes, it performs as a Sword +1.","damage":"1d8","bonus":1,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"Z4p6M2YjKT1V8BxN"}
{"name":"Sword +1, Wounding","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"The keen edge of this razor-sharp mithril blade opens wounds that cannot be healed by spells, regeneration, or any magical means. Only a Wish or natural healing will close wounds from this blade. Moreover, for 10 consecutive rounds after a successful attack with a Sword of Wounding, the target takes an additional 1 point of damage. Binding wounds may (50%) negate the extra damage.","damage":"1d8","bonus":1,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"D5r8N1JmWP2Q6LyO"}
{"name":"Sword +2, Berserker","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This cursed sword, when used in battle, impassions the wielder into a berserk rage. The wielder always attacks the nearest being and fights until unconscious, dead, or no living creature remains within 60 feet. While enraged, the wielder has a -2 armor class penalty.","damage":"1d8","bonus":2,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"F8h2P6VaRO5N9ZbT"}
{"name":"Sword +2, Giant Slayer","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This is a +3 blade against giants, including the cyclops, ettin, ogre, ogre mage, or titan. Against true giants (Cloud, Fire, Frost, Hill, Stone, or Storm) the sword scores double damage.","damage":"1d8","bonus":2,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"M3g7L5KqUF8R4XjU"}
{"name":"Sword +2, Nine Lives Stealer","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This sword drains life from an opponent. On an unmodified, natural 20 attack roll the target must successfully save (Spell) or die. If successful, the sword’s life-stealing ability fails and no drain is expended. The weapon can drain nine lives before it reverts to a simple +2 magic blade.","damage":"1d8","bonus":2,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"X9t4K3ZhNR2U8FyW"}
{"name":"Sword +2, Sun Blade","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This blade is a +2 weapon that enhances to +4 weapon against evil-aligned creatures. Against undead, the sword deals double rolled damage for 10 rounds. The wielder of the sword may twirl the weapon above his or her head and create a bright glowing light equal to daylight (useable once per day). The light initially extends in a 10-foot radius and expands 10 feet per round that the weapon is twirled, to a maximum radius of 30 feet.","damage":"1d8","bonus":2,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"P2j1W8KrVF6Y3LnQ"}
{"name":"Sword +3, Frost Brand","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"The blue blade of this sword is freezing to the touch. The sword serves as a +6 weapon against creatures that live in hot environments or employ a fire-based attack form. The blade sheds the equivalent of torch-light when below zero degrees Fahrenheit. The light cannot be concealed or dimmed. The sword offers its wielder the same protection as a Ring of Fire Resistance. This weapon extinguishes mundane fires in a 10 foot radius.","damage":"1d8","bonus":3,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"T1c2S4NkOB3M9VpW"}
{"name":"Sword +3, Sharpness","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This mithril sword is so keen and sharp, it can sever a body part. On an unmodified attack roll of 20, the blade severs (1d10): Hand (1-5), Arm at the elbow (6-7), Arm (8-9), Head (10). On command, the sword provides torchlight equivalency.","damage":"1d8","bonus":3,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"R7d9J3XmQL5H1NbP"}
{"name":"Sword +3, Skewering","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"This +3 magic weapon may impale, or skewer, a humanoid opponent to death.","damage":"1d8","bonus":3,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"B4y7F2PnKD6R8QvJ"}
{"name":"Sword +4, Defender","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"The wielder may, from round to round, distribute the weapon’s +4 bonus to attack/damage or armor class. The bearer may, for example, apply +1 to hit/damage and +3 to armor class at the beginning of one round or +3 to hit/damage and +1 to armor class the next, as desired.","damage":"1d8","bonus":4,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"S5x8H4KnOC2W7LbM"}
{"name":"Sword +5, Dragonslayer","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"The hilt of this mighty Sword +2 depicts a jeweled dragon. Against a dragon, the sword is fully +5, scores triple damage, and provides +3 on Breath saving throws. Roll randomly to determine the sword’s dragon type (d10): Black (1-2), Blue (3-4), Green (5-6), Red (7-8), White (9-10).","damage":"1d8","bonus":5,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"E9n3T1LrOM6V7KbU"}
{"name":"Sword +5, Holy Avenger","permission":{"default":0,"HehChXVvWoU0T1uV":3},"type":"weapon","data":{"range":{"short":0,"medium":0,"long":0},"save":"","pattern":"transparent","description":"In the hands of a paladin, this +2 holy sword becomes fully +5. If wielded by a paladin, the blade grants magic resistance of 50% and may Dispel Magic (cast as magic-user of the same level) in a five-foot radius at-will. When used against chaotic evil opponents, the sword provides an additional +10 to damage rolls.","damage":"1d8","bonus":5,"tags":[{"title":"Melee","value":"Melee"}],"slow":false,"missile":false,"melee":true,"cost":0,"equipped":false,"weight":60,"counter":{"value":0,"max":0}},"flags":{},"img":"icons\\svg\\sword.svg","effects":[],"_id":"H1q6J9XtOL4S5YnP"}
